<title>FINLAND: FINNLINES 1996 PROFIT RISES 28 PCT.</title>
<headline>FINNLINES 1996 PROFIT RISES 28 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	    404 vs 315</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  14.65 vs 11.11</p>
<p>*Sales						3,236 vs 4,338</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    4.00 vs 3.00</p>
<p> Operating profit				   444 vs 370</p>
<p>NOTE - The median forecast for Finnish cargo shipping</p>
<p>company Finnlines Oy was for a 408 million markka profit.</p>
<p>*The 25 percent decline in 1996 sales on 1995 was mainly due</p>
<p>to divestment of the Oy Huolintakeskus Ab subsidiary, Finnlines</p>
<p>said in its 1996 report.</p>
<p>The item &quot;sales&quot; is net sales minus sales adjustment items.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
